cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PLM Indicator Catalog: 62-Indicator Design Specification for Population Learning Management"
message: "If you use this catalog, please cite the accompanying paper and include a reference to this repository."
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-03-01
