    affiliation: "Faculty of Environmental, Life, Natural Science and Technology, Okayama University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PLM-research/PLM-indicators"
abstract: >-
  This catalog contains 62 indicators organized across six domains
  (Learning Vital Signs, Learning Risk Stratification, Social Determinants
  of Learning, Intervention Effectiveness, Resource Efficiency, Learning
  Engagement) and three administrative layers (Macro / Meso / Micro).
  It serves as the design-phase artifact for Population Learning
  Management (PLM), a Design Science Research project that transfers
  Population Health Management (PHM) constructs to K-12 educational
  decision-making.
keywords:
  - population learning management
  - learning analytics
  - educational dashboard
  - design science research
  - population health management
  - K-12 education
